10. Use of investigational drugs within 30 days or 5 half-lives (whichever is longer) or discontinuation of monoclonal antibodies with unknown half-life within 6 months; prior to scheduled administration of the investigational drugs on Day 1 of this study.

Inclusion Criteria:

* Male or female subjects of any ethnicity and age \>/=18 but \ 1.7 or any active or recent (within 10 to 30 days) hemorrhage;
