Inclusion Criteria:

* Age ≥ 18 years old;
* Body mass index ≤ 30 kg/㎡;
* American Society of Anesthesiologists Classification: I-II level;
* Patients who undergo elective supratentorial tumor resection surgery;
* Mechanical ventilation during operation ≥ 4h;
