* treatment with either oral or intravenous furosemide \>=40 mg/day or equivalent at the time of inclusion; not previously treated with evidence-based therapies (angiotensin-converting enzyme inhibitors or angiotensin receptor blockers and beta-blockers) or receiving \ =18 years;
